  "description": "<p data-end=\"713\" data-start=\"214\"><strong data-end=\"240\" data-start=\"214\">&bull; Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"243\" data-start=\"240\">The <strong data-end=\"281\" data-start=\"247\">Build Stuff Ambassador Program</strong> is an affiliate-style initiative that empowers community leaders, tech influencers, and developer advocates to promote <strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"401\">Build Stuff Conference 2025</strong>&mdash;a world-class software development event happening in <strong data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"487\">Vilnius, November 13&ndash;15, 2025</strong>. Ambassadors use their networks to sell tickets, earn generous commissions, and gain access to exclusive perks and resources while promoting an unforgettable experience for the tech community.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"715\"><strong data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"715\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"751\">\r\n<li data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"751\">\r\n<p data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"753\">💸 <strong data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"756\">Earn 15% Commission</strong>: Ambassadors receive <strong data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"801\">15% of every ticket sold</strong> through their unique referral link.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"868\">\r\n<p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"870\">🎯 <strong data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"873\">Milestone Bonuses</strong>: Earn an <strong data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"904\">extra &euro;200</strong> for every <strong data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"929\">20 tickets sold</strong> &mdash; stackable, with no upper limit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"985\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"987\">🎁 <strong data-end=\"1020\" data-start=\"990\">Professional Marketing Kit</strong>: Access ready-made banners, visuals, and templates to boost your reach.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1095\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1097\">📲 <strong data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"1100\">Real-Time Support &amp; Tips</strong>: Join the <strong data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1139\">private Telegram group</strong> for live updates, announcements, and motivation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1217\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1219\">🚀 <strong data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1222\">Promote a One-of-a-Kind Experience</strong>: Build Stuff 2025 features top-tier 100+ speakers, technical keynites and wellness activities, networking parties, and a welcoming vibe that sets it apart from traditional tech conferences.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1437\"><strong data-end=\"1457\" data-start=\"1437\">&bull; Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1801\" data-start=\"1460\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1460\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1462\"><strong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1462\">15% commission</strong> is paid out promptly upon confirmation of ticket sales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1658\" data-start=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1658\" data-start=\"1541\"><strong data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1541\">&euro;200 milestone bonuses</strong> are issued once the 20-ticket threshold is reached &mdash; available for every multiple of 20.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1745\" data-start=\"1659\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1745\" data-start=\"1661\">Payments are made via <strong data-end=\"1710\" data-start=\"1683\">bank transfer or PayPal</strong>, based on your preferred method.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1801\" data-start=\"1746\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1801\" data-start=\"1748\">Full sales transparency with personal tracking links.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
